<title>USA: GM July US total car sales rise.</title>
<headline>GM July US total car sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Motors Corp</p>
<p>			Jul 1-31, 1997     Jul 1-31, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Total Car		237,267	   230,456	     +3.0</p>
<p> Total Truck	    181,835	   163,070	    +11.5</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Jul 31, 1997 Jan 1-Jul 31, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Total Car	    1,588,756	 1,733,391	     -7.8</p>
<p> Total Truck	  1,205,427	 1,185,750	     +2.2</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 26 in latest month  vs 26, 179 for year to date vs 180 in year ago.</p>
<p>Note - Results include Saab Automobile AB, a joint venture of GM and  Investor AB of 2,801 vs 3,485 in July '97 and '96 periods, respectively,  and 16,698 vs 17,061 in '97 and '96 year-to-date periods.</p>
</text>
